--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Unofficial Tool
   The Project is an unofficial tool developed by the player community. It is not affiliated with, licensed by, or endorsed by the developer or publisher of "Dread Hunger". It targets self-hosted Dedicated Server environments after the end of official operations and was developed solely for technical compatibility and interoperability. You bear all operational and legal-compliance risk of using it.

