   Intellectual property rights in the Original Game Assets belong to Digital Confectioners Ltd. (New Zealand) and any other lawful rightsholders (together, the "Game Rightsholders"). Ownership of, and the scope of rights in, the Paid Commercial UE4 Assets depend on each original asset's ownership and license terms and on the Game Rightsholders' actual purchase and licensing status. The Game Rightsholders and the lawful rightsholders of the Paid Commercial UE4 Assets are together the "Lawful Rightsholders".

