   (b) Derived Files; and
   (c) feature ideas, gameplay mechanics, memory offsets and parameter definitions, data and communication formats, and interoperability interfaces relating to the game.
   This Section does not affect any rights of the Lawful Rightsholders in the Original Game and Related Commercial Assets, or anyone's rights in original content that they created independently and that is separable from those assets (including Independent Works).

5. Covenant Not to Assert
   By accepting this License, you agree not to assert copyright or exclusive control over anything listed in Section 4(a)–(c) against the maintainer, contributors, or anyone else using the Project under this License, and not to rely on it to demand takedown, restrict distribution, or establish exclusivity. A breach of this Section is handled under Article 6.

