   (b) Keep this License. License the Licensed Material in the Modified Version, and your own changes, under the latest version of this License published by the maintainer in the Project's repository at the time you Distribute or begin Public Operation. If the maintainer later publishes a newer version, move any Modified Version you are still Distributing or Publicly Operating to that version within 30 days. You may not switch to a closed-source license or a license that permits commercial exploitation.
   (c) Retain notices. Keep the full text of this License, the original copyright notices, and attribution to the original project intact, and state that you made changes if you did.

2. No Closed-Source or Gated Distribution
   You may not Distribute the Project or a Modified Version in closed-source form, as obfuscated-only or encrypted-wrapper builds, in a form obtainable only by payment or by members of a group, or as the exclusive property of any party.

