Article 6 | Termination and Reinstatement
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

1. Automatic Termination
   If you violate any term of this License, your rights under it terminate automatically.

2. Reinstatement on Cure
   If you cure the violation within 30 days after you first learn of it or are notified of it, whichever is earlier, your rights are reinstated automatically from the date of cure. Automatic reinstatement does not apply to a repeat violation of Article 5; reinstatement then requires the maintainer's written consent. Reinstatement does not affect the maintainer's rights regarding conduct during the period of violation.

3. Obligations After Termination
   While your rights are terminated and not reinstated, you must immediately stop copying, modifying, Distributing, and Publicly Operating the Project and any Modified Version. Continuing to do so infringes the copyright in the Licensed Material, and the maintainer reserves all rights to enforce it under law, including by notice to hosting platforms.

4. Downstream Recipients Unaffected
   Termination of your rights does not affect recipients who obtained copies from you under this License and who themselves comply with it.

